Package: rfExtra
Title: Extension for 'randomForest' package
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0), stats, randomForest (>= 4.7-1)
Suggests: RColorBrewer, MASS, parallel, knitr, rmarkdown
Author: R and C code original by Andy Liaw and Matthew Wiener. Fortran original by Leo Breiman and Adele Cutler. 
Description: The package contains additional analytical functions based on the randomForest package, including permutation-based group variable importance measures.
